# Line endings are decided here rather than by whatever each contributor's Git happens to be
# configured to do. Two files in this repository were stored CRLF while the other hundred and
# sixty-seven were LF, and commits that touched either one flipped it - which turns a thirty-line
# change into a two-thousand-line rewrite in review, and makes a branch conflict on a file nobody
# disagreed about.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Except the one kind of file that has to keep CRLF to run at all.
*.bat text eol=crlf

# And the ones that are not text, so Git never looks inside them for lines.
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.keystore binary
